{
  "study": "DAIR-V2X-Seq-SPD published roadside example, one intersection, one sequence, two sequence-local pedestrians; all four evaluable windows. Source annotations provide the tracked boxes and 3D centres. RTMPose estimates 2D joints in the five original historical images.",
